    {
      "source": "Abstract class that adapts a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Future.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Future</code></a> parameterized over S into a <code>Future</code>\nparameterized over T. All methods are delegated to the adaptee, where <a href=\"#get()\"><code>get()</code></a>\nand <a href=\"#get(long,java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit)\"><code>get(long, TimeUnit)</code></a> call <a href=\"#adapt(S)\"><code>adapt(Object)</code></a> on the adaptee's result.",
      "translation": "抽象类，它将针对 S 参数化的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Future.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Future</code></a>` 适配为针对 T 参数化的 `<code>Future</code>`。所有方法均委托给被适配对象，其中 `<a href=\"#get()\"><code>get()</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"#get(long,java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit)\"><code>get(long, TimeUnit)</code></a>` 会调用被适配对象结果上的 `<a href=\"#adapt(S)\"><code>adapt(Object)</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Constructs a new <code>FutureAdapter</code> with the given adaptee.",
      "translation": "构造一个新的带有给定适配器的<code>FutureAdapter</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Adapts the given adaptee's result into T.",
      "translation": "将给定适配器的结果转换为 T。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the adaptee.",
      "translation": "返回适配器。",
      "count": 2
    },
